{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50892","headline":"献淮南崔相公 · 罗隐","name":"献淮南崔相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天临黄合如秋净，日照洪钧若昼清。\n虎帐坐分真宰气，象筵吹出泰阶声。\n云霞自入淮王梦，风月谁含炀帝情。\n见说蓬莱百王发，玉皇吟出广陵城。\n（此见《永乐大典》卷二七四四「八灰」「崔」字「崔某」条引《维扬志》〖四函三十四册〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}